check_content:
Verify NixOS has the audit service configured with the following command:

$ grep security.audit /etc/nixos/configuration.nix

 security.auditd.enable = true;
 security.audit.enable = true;

If auditd, and audit are not set to true or lock, this is a finding.

fixtext:
Configure the system to enable the audit service by adding or updating the following configurations in /etc/nixos/configuration.nix:

 security.auditd.enable = true;
 security.audit.enable = true;

Rebuild the system with the following command:

$ sudo nixos-rebuild switch
